<title>USA: CCC invites offers for 10.37 million bushels corn.</title>
<headline>CCC invites offers for 10.37 million bushels corn.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it was inviting offers for a total of 10.37 million bushels of corn and 19,473 bushels of barley in a catalog sale.</p>
<p>The feedgrain is stored in U.S. warehouses.</p>
<p>Offers must be received by May 20.</p>
<p>((Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
